{
    "talkId": "6984701",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 43,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Black Screen": 1,
        "Kuki Shinobu": 15,
        "Player": 11,
        "Thoma": 16
    },
    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "698470101",
            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
            "text": "...Which is to say that, as long as someone passes the exam and gets a Domestic Services Provider License, they'll be able to take more repair and cleaning jobs."
        },
        {
            "id": "698470102",
            "speaker": "Thoma",
            "text": "That's exactly it, Ms. Kuki. The Yashiro Commission is promoting training and exams for housekeeping skills to help boost employment opportunities for residents seeking work.",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698470103",
                    "text": "Going to take another exam, Shinobu?",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698470105",
                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                            "text": "#Oh, hey, {NICKNAME}. That's right, I'm looking into the Yashiro Commission's housekeeping training programs."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698470106",
                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                            "text": "Thoma says that as long as you complete a full course and pass the exam, the Yashiro Commission will issue you an official license. It's a significant advantage for job seekers."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698470107",
                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                            "text": "I imagine that with your talent, getting the license should be a piece of cake."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698470108",
                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                            "text": "You flatter me. But while exams don't faze me, the rest of the Arataki Gang..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698470109",
                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                            "text": "Boss's last job was to give exfoliating back scrubs at Aisa Bathhouse. But he went at it a bit too hard, and ended up scrubbing skin off too..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698470110",
                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                            "text": "Last month, Akira \"helped\" grill skewers at Shimura's. For every one he grilled, he ate three. Shimura's would've been in the red for the whole month if bystanders hadn't intervened."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698470111",
                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                            "text": "And then there's Mamoru and Genta... Ushi's the only one who doesn't cause trouble, and that's because he doesn't need to work.",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "698470112",
                                    "text": "Wouldn't that... get them fired?",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698470114",
                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                            "text": "Right on the money. When I asked, they all replied in perfect unison:"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698470115",
                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                            "text": "\"Sorry, we got fired again, hehe.\""
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698470116",
                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                            "text": "In short, aside from me, the entire Arataki Gang is presently unemployed.",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698470117",
                                                    "text": "Ah, so they're living a free and unstructured lifestyle, bereft of social attachment...",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470119",
                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                            "text": "So, Ms. Kuki, I take it that you intend to secure licenses for the gang, and in doing so, improve their job prospects?"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470120",
                                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                                            "text": "Yup. My thoughts exactly."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470121",
                                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                                            "text": "But just dragging them there to take the test is probably pointless. It's better if I get the license first."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470122",
                                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                                            "text": "Then, I can go back and tutor them myself. That's much more likely to succeed."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470123",
                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                            "text": "Very thorough. In that case, are you ready to enroll right now?"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470124",
                                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                                            "text": "Give me a bit. I need to go back and fetch my documents, and also give the Boss a heads up."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470125",
                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                            "text": "Sounds good. Once you're ready, you can find me at the Yashiro Commission to register. You can sign up at any time before I go on leave."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470126",
                                                            "speaker": "Kuki Shinobu",
                                                            "text": "Got it. I'll be quick. Thanks, Thoma."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470127",
                                                            "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                            "text": "Shinobu strides off..."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698470128",
                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                            "text": "#Now that's someone who doesn't mess around! Been a while, {NICKNAME}. What do you think?",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698470129",
                                                                    "text": "Without her, the Arataki Gang would be done for.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698470131",
                                                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                                                            "text": "You're going to take a vacation, Thoma?"
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698470132",
                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                            "text": "I am. The Yashiro Commission is spearheading the domestic services training program, and once I finish assisting the others with the registration process, I plan on taking a long vacation."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698470133",
                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                            "text": "Lord Kamisato has already approved. I plan to head to Mondstadt to help my mother with a few things.",
                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698470134",
                                                                                    "text": "Your mother?",
                                                                                    "response": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470136",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "What's with the surprised look? Ah... I don't think I've ever shared much about my family with you."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470137",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "There's nothing special about them. My mom was born and raised in Mondstadt, and she's a Knight of Favonius."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470138",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "Contact between Mondstadt and Inazuma has risen since the Sakoku Decree was lifted, so it's gotten easier to write."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470139",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "Haha, once I got a letter from her demanding I send her Inazuman wines so she could taste \"what you're drinking over there.\""
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470140",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "But what can possibly rival Dandelion Wine? Shame, though. Even a taste of home might be a luxury for her now."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470141",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "Grand Master Varka's expedition is camped in Nod-Krai, and she received her orders to transfer. She's already en route to join them."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470142",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "It's been years since I last went back... Once I get there, I'll help sort through everything she left behind and see how much Mondstadt's changed."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698470143",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Thoma",
                                                                                            "text": "Given how far your travels take you, maybe we'll bump into each other there."
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698470135",
                                                                                    "text": "You're going back to Mondstadt?"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698470130",
                                                                    "text": "Looks like she's going to rack up another certification."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698470118",
                                                    "text": "Pretty on-brand for the Arataki Gang."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "698470113",
                                    "text": "Their jobs..."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "698470104",
                    "text": "Job-hunting, Shinobu?"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}